    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../query/MongoEntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.repository.query\"><code>MongoEntityInformation</code></a> implementation using a <a href=\"../../core/mapping/MongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentEntity</code></a> instance to lookup the necessary\ninformation. Can be configured with a custom collection to be returned which will trump the one returned by the\n<a href=\"../../core/mapping/MongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentEntity</code></a> if given.",
      "translation": "使用 <a href=\"../query/MongoEntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.repository.query\"><code>MongoEntityInformation</code></a> 接口的实现，通过 <a href=\"../../core/mapping/MongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentEntity</code></a> 实例来查找必要的信息。可以配置为返回自定义集合；如果提供了该配置，它将覆盖由 <a href=\"../../core/mapping/MongoPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.mapping\"><code>MongoPersistentEntity</code></a> 返回的集合。",
